id: petrification-barrage-again
name: Petrification Barrage (Second)
advancement: true
prerequisite: Tier of Power 4+, Petrification Barrage
tpCost: 10
# "You can gain this Advancement twice" - its second time, another use more.
extraUses: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Petrification Barrage gained a second time: once more again each Combat Round.
text: >
  Petrification Barrage: You are capable of petrifying others more quickly.
  –Prerequisites: Tier of Power 4+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may use this Unique Ability an additional time per each Combat Round. You can gain this Advancement
  twice.
